{"id":"7443277cb04c8e58","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-theory-choice.md","title":"依据明确要求取极小可接受理论","display":"df-truth-theory-choice — 依据明确要求取极小可接受理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-theory-choice","aliases":["91-df-truth-theory-choice","91-df-theory-choice","91-df-truth-choice"],"display":"df-truth-theory-choice — 依据明确要求取极小可接受理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-theory]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-theory-choice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-theory-choice</span><span>91-df-theory-choice</span><span>91-df-truth-choice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-theory-choice — 依据明确要求取极小可接受理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C\">\\(\\mathfrak C\\)</span> 为候选集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为要求集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Meets}\">\\(\\operatorname{Meets}\\)</span> 为已指定的满足要求关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_R\">\\(\\preceq_R\\)</span> 为偏好预序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Admissible}_R,\\operatorname{Choice}\">\\(\\operatorname{Admissible}_R,\\operatorname{Choice}\\)</span> 为下述集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec_R\">\\(\\prec_R\\)</span> 是预序的严格部分。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}choice}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathfrak C:\\forall r\\in R\\;\\operatorname{Meets}(S,r)\\},\\qquad\nU\\prec_R S\\coloneqq U\\preceq_R S\\land\\neg(S\\preceq_R U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}choice}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathfrak C:\\forall r\\in R\\;\\operatorname{Meets}(S,r)\\},\\qquad\nU\\prec_R S\\coloneqq U\\preceq_R S\\land\\neg(S\\preceq_R U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Choice}(R,\\mathfrak C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C):\n\\neg\\exists U\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\\;U\\prec_R S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Choice}(R,\\mathfrak C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C):\n\\neg\\exists U\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\\;U\\prec_R S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本地选择模型，可能无极小候选、多个极小候选或没有可接受候选，不保证唯一解。\n若要求对 PA 算术保守，原书完整 TB、UTB 以及只含基础归纳的 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 均满足；旧表将三者一概写作“不得加入真理语言归纳”错误。若要求强 Kleene 语义需区分经典 KF 与部分逻辑 PKF；若要求捕获/释放闭包，FS 满足但 ω 不一致。VF 的路线是超赋值。\n选择需固定理论版本、目标语言和可证要求。比较预序也须单独提供，不能从系统名或哲学评价自动产生。</p>\n<p>来源：第 21 章的保守性讨论与第 23 章的本体论约化讨论；本地预序选择约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak C","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Meets}","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Admissible}_R,\\operatorname{Choice}","display":false},{"tex":"\\prec_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}choice}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathfrak C:\\forall r\\in R\\;\\operatorname{Meets}(S,r)\\},\\qquad\nU\\prec_R S\\coloneqq U\\preceq_R S\\land\\neg(S\\preceq_R U).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Choice}(R,\\mathfrak C)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C):\n\\neg\\exists U\\in\\operatorname{Admissible}_R(\\mathfrak C)\\;U\\prec_R S\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"^-","display":false}],"bytes":1850,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory-choice]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]